concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1050-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1050(5) Minister may authorise an external dispute resolution scheme"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-1050-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) In an instrument under subsection (1) or (4), the Minister:  (a) must specify the day the authorisation, variation or revocation comes into force; and  (b) may specify, vary or revoke conditions relating to the authorisation. Note: Once the authorisation of an external dispute resolution scheme comes into force, the scheme is known as the AFCA scheme and the operator is known as AFCA (AFCA is short for Australian Financial Complaints Authority): see the definitions of AFCA and AFCA scheme in section 761A. Subdivision B—Mandatory requirements and general considerations" ;
    skos:definition "(5) In an instrument under subsection (1) or (4), the Minister:  (a) must specify the day the authorisation, variation or revocation comes into force; and  (b) may specify, vary or revoke conditions relating to the authorisation. Note: Once the authorisation of an external dispute resolution scheme comes into force, the scheme is known as the AFCA scheme and the operator is known as AFCA (AFCA is short for Australian Financial Complaints Authority): see the definitions of AFCA and AFCA scheme in section 761A. Subdivision B—Mandatory requirements and general considerations"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b1d0fc2f92324392c8a2369fbe668b7d0b52c3129f4b9552db48049662ab8fe8" ;
    values:partOf concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1050 ;
    cof:pageNumber "12"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Specify day authorisation comes into force and conditions" ;
    dc:description "(a) must specify the day the authorisation, variation or revocation comes into force; (b) may specify, vary or revoke conditions relating to the authorisation." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <c2022c00235.pdf> ;
    dc:source "c2022c00235.pdf, p.12" ;
