concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1051 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1051 Mandatory requirements"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-1051 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The mandatory requirements for an external dispute resolution scheme are:  (a) the organisational requirements under subsection (2); and  (b) the operator requirements under subsection (3); and  (c) the operational requirements under subsection (4); and  (d) the compliance requirements under subsection (5). Organisational requirements  (2) The organisational requirements are that:  (a) the membership of the scheme is open to every entity that is required, under:  Schedule 1  External dispute resolution" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The mandatory requirements for an external dispute resolution scheme are:  (a) the organisational requirements under subsection (2); and  (b) the operator requirements under subsection (3); and  (c) the operational requirements under subsection (4); and  (d) the compliance requirements under subsection (5). Organisational requirements  (2) The organisational requirements are that:  (a) the membership of the scheme is open to every entity that is required, under:  Schedule 1  External dispute resolution"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "42c332a1878122dc02510426f4cb7a596028a062c740fb059ea77cf361182a9d" ;
    cof:pageNumber "13"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1051-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1051-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <c2022c00235.pdf> ;
    dc:source "c2022c00235.pdf, p.13" .
