    cof:title "1051(2) Mandatory requirements" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The organisational requirements are that:  (a) the membership of the scheme is open to every entity that is required, under:  Schedule 1  External dispute resolution" ;
    cof:pageNumber "13"^^xsd:integer .

concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1051a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1051A General considerations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-1051a ;
    values:originalText "The general considerations for an external dispute resolution scheme are the following:  (a) the accessibility of the scheme;  (b) the independence of the scheme;  (c) the fairness of the scheme;  (d) the accountability of the scheme;  (e) the efficiency of the scheme;  (f) the effectiveness of the scheme." ;
    skos:definition "The general considerations for an external dispute resolution scheme are the following:  (a) the accessibility of the scheme;  (b) the independence of the scheme;  (c) the fairness of the scheme;  (d) the accountability of the scheme;  (e) the efficiency of the scheme;  (f) the effectiveness of the scheme."@en ;
