concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1052b-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1052B(2) Directions to increase limits on the value of claims"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-1052b-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) However:  (a) ASIC must not give a direction under this section unless ASIC has given AFCA written notice of at least 1 month of ASIC’s intention to issue the direction; and  (b) a direction under this section must not apply in relation to complaints AFCA received before ASIC gives the direction." ;
