doc:sch-1-sec-1052c-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "1052C(2) General directions to AFCA" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The notice must set out:  (a) the specific measures that the direction will require AFCA to take to comply with the requirements or condition; and  (b) the reasons for ASIC’s intention to give the direction. Issuing a direction" ;
