concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1052c-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1052C(3) General directions to AFCA"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-1052c-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) If, after receiving the notice:  (a) AFCA does not take those specific measures; and  (b) ASIC still considers that it is appropriate to give the direction to AFCA; ASIC may give AFCA the direction, in writing, with a statement setting out the reasons for giving the direction.  External dispute resolution  Schedule 1 Amendments applying from the day after Royal Assent  Part 1  Treasury Laws Amendment (Putting Consumers First—Establishment of the Australian Financial Complaints Authority) Act 2018 Compilation date: 10/08/2022 Registered: 25/08/2022" ;
    skos:definition "(3) If, after receiving the notice:  (a) AFCA does not take those specific measures; and  (b) ASIC still considers that it is appropriate to give the direction to AFCA; ASIC may give AFCA the direction, in writing, with a statement setting out the reasons for giving the direction.  External dispute resolution  Schedule 1 Amendments applying from the day after Royal Assent  Part 1  Treasury Laws Amendment (Putting Consumers First—Establishment of the Australian Financial Complaints Authority) Act 2018 Compilation date: 10/08/2022 Registered: 25/08/2022"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6fb31d1940245cf9b9b29e3cbba02a2b0d45e256b620fc79ec8f1fef20a5c604" ;
    values:partOf concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1052c ;
    cof:pageNumber "18"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "ASIC may give AFCA direction with reasons." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
