concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1052c-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1052C(7) General directions to AFCA"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-1052c-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) If AFCA fails to comply with the direction, ASIC may apply to the Court for, and the Court may make, an order that AFCA comply with the direction. Varying or revoking a direction" ;
