concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1052d a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1052D Approval of material changes to the AFCA scheme"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-1052d ;
    values:originalText "(1) AFCA may request ASIC to approve a material change to the AFCA scheme. Note: A material change must not be made to the scheme without ASIC’s approval (see paragraph 1051(5)(b)).  (2) ASIC may, by written notice given to AFCA, approve the change.  (3) In considering whether to approve the change, ASIC must take into account the following in relation to the scheme as it is proposed to be changed:  Schedule 1  External dispute resolution" ;
    skos:definition "(1) AFCA may request ASIC to approve a material change to the AFCA scheme. Note: A material change must not be made to the scheme without ASIC’s approval (see paragraph 1051(5)(b)).  (2) ASIC may, by written notice given to AFCA, approve the change.  (3) In considering whether to approve the change, ASIC must take into account the following in relation to the scheme as it is proposed to be changed:  Schedule 1  External dispute resolution"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0797a28451aa3e2d29cef098037a4c4b3874f96cff8820bd040a317f837cd3ea" ;
    cof:pageNumber "19"^^xsd:integer ;
