    cml:confidence "1.0000"^^xsd:decimal ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .
doc:sch-1-sec-1052e-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "1052E(2) Referring matters to appropriate authorities" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) However, if:  (a) the complaint relates to the scheme provided for by the Australian Defence Force Cover Act 2015; and  (b) subsection (1) applies because AFCA becomes aware that:  (i) a serious contravention of any law may have occurred; or  (ii) a party to the complaint may have refused or failed to give effect to a determination made by AFCA; AFCA must instead give particulars of the contravention, refusal or failure to the Minister administering that Act and the Minister  External dispute resolution  Schedule 1 Amendments applying from the day after Royal Assent  Part 1  Treasury Laws Amendment (Putting Consumers First—Establishment of the Australian Financial Complaints Authority) Act 2018 Compilation date: 10/08/2022 Registered: 25/08/2022  administering the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013. Referring settled complaints" ;
    cof:pageNumber "20"^^xsd:integer .

concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1052e-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1052E(3) Referring matters to appropriate authorities"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-1052e-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) If:  (a) the parties to a complaint made under the AFCA scheme agree to a settlement of the complaint; and  (b) AFCA thinks the settlement may require investigation; AFCA may give particulars of the settlement to one or more of APRA, ASIC or the Commissioner of Taxation. Referring systemic issues" ;
    skos:definition "(3) If:  (a) the parties to a complaint made under the AFCA scheme agree to a settlement of the complaint; and  (b) AFCA thinks the settlement may require investigation; AFCA may give particulars of the settlement to one or more of APRA, ASIC or the Commissioner of Taxation. Referring systemic issues"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "dc3007e5863bc4b3e196bac5adc58cdbd1d40064f455c6c3032f3ecdba34434e" ;
    values:partOf concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1052e ;
