concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1052e-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1052E(4) Referring matters to appropriate authorities"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-1052e-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) If AFCA considers that there is a systemic issue arising from the consideration of complaints under the AFCA scheme, AFCA must give particulars of the issue to one or more of APRA, ASIC or the Commissioner of Taxation." ;
