concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1057 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1057 Appeals to the Federal Court from determination of"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-1057 ;
    values:originalText "superannuation complaint  (1) A party to a superannuation complaint may appeal to the Federal Court, on a question of law, from AFCA’s determination of the complaint.  Schedule 1  External dispute resolution" ;
    skos:definition "superannuation complaint  (1) A party to a superannuation complaint may appeal to the Federal Court, on a question of law, from AFCA’s determination of the complaint.  Schedule 1  External dispute resolution"@en ;
