concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-12 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "12 Subsection 57(2) (note)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-12 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the note, substitute: Note: A person affected by the outcome of the reconsideration of the decision may make a complaint: (a) under the AFCA scheme (within the meaning of Chapter 7 of the Corporations Act 2001), but not before the authorisation of the scheme comes into force; or (b) under the Superannuation (Resolution of Complaints) Act 1993, but not on or after the day on or after which complaints cannot be made because of section 14AB of that Act. Australian Prudential Regulation Authority Act 1998" ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the note, substitute: Note: A person affected by the outcome of the reconsideration of the decision may make a complaint: (a) under the AFCA scheme (within the meaning of Chapter 7 of the Corporations Act 2001), but not before the authorisation of the scheme comes into force; or (b) under the Superannuation (Resolution of Complaints) Act 1993, but not on or after the day on or after which complaints cannot be made because of section 14AB of that Act. Australian Prudential Regulation Authority Act 1998"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f0e7aecf6a7ce513730ad6fca78befae831fd76407f825c8f994b90c9c326de9" ;
    cof:pageNumber "39"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "A person affected by the outcome of reconsideration may make a complaint under specific schemes." ;
