concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-15 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15 Section 292-330 (note)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-15 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the note, substitute: Note: If a person is dissatisfied with a statement given to the Commissioner by a superannuation provider under section 390-5 in Schedule 1 to the Taxation Administration Act 1953, the person may make a complaint: (a) under the AFCA scheme (within the meaning of Chapter 7 of the Corporations Act 2001), but not before the authorisation of the scheme comes into force; or (b) under section 15CA of the Superannuation (Resolution of Complaints) Act 1993, but not on or after the day on or after which complaints cannot be made because of section 14AB of that Act. Retirement Savings Accounts Act 1997" ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the note, substitute: Note: If a person is dissatisfied with a statement given to the Commissioner by a superannuation provider under section 390-5 in Schedule 1 to the Taxation Administration Act 1953, the person may make a complaint: (a) under the AFCA scheme (within the meaning of Chapter 7 of the Corporations Act 2001), but not before the authorisation of the scheme comes into force; or (b) under section 15CA of the Superannuation (Resolution of Complaints) Act 1993, but not on or after the day on or after which complaints cannot be made because of section 14AB of that Act. Retirement Savings Accounts Act 1997"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6563561505f35e3a92bf6048ad5154b3e097c15331b4419c087c6f5ef18f79d8" ;
    cof:pageNumber "40"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Complaint procedure under AFCA scheme and Superannuation (Resolution of Complaints) Act 1993" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <c2022c00235.pdf> ;
    dc:source "c2022c00235.pdf, p.40" ;
    cml:asserts concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-15-norm .
