doc:sch-1-sec-22-ss-2a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "22(2A) After subsection 58(2)" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2A) To avoid doubt, paragraph (2)(fa) applies in relation to any requirement imposed under the AFCA scheme, whether the requirement is referred to, in Part 7.10A of the Corporations Act 2001 or in a determination under that Part, as a direction or by any other name." ;
    cof:pageNumber "42"^^xsd:integer .

