concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-28 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "28 Section 155-90 in Schedule 1 (note)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-28 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the note, substitute: Note: If an individual is dissatisfied with a statement given to the Commissioner by a superannuation provider under section 390-5 in this Schedule, the individual may make a complaint: (a) under the AFCA scheme (within the meaning of Chapter 7 of the Corporations Act 2001), but not before the authorisation of the scheme comes into force; or (b) under section 15CA of the Superannuation (Resolution of Complaints) Act 1993, but not on or after the day on or after  Schedule 1  External dispute resolution" ;
