concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-52 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "52 Subsection 24(3) (note)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-52 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the note, substitute: Note: If a member is dissatisfied with an assessment in so far as it relates to the calculation of the member’s surchargeable contributions, as based on an amount or amounts set out in a statement given to the Commissioner by a superannuation provider under section 13, the member may make a complaint under the AFCA scheme (within the meaning of Chapter 7 of the Corporations Act 2001) about the unfairness or unreasonableness of the superannuation provider’s decision to set out the amount or any of the amounts in the statement. Superannuation (Resolution of Complaints) Act 1993" ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the note, substitute: Note: If a member is dissatisfied with an assessment in so far as it relates to the calculation of the member’s surchargeable contributions, as based on an amount or amounts set out in a statement given to the Commissioner by a superannuation provider under section 13, the member may make a complaint under the AFCA scheme (within the meaning of Chapter 7 of the Corporations Act 2001) about the unfairness or unreasonableness of the superannuation provider’s decision to set out the amount or any of the amounts in the statement. Superannuation (Resolution of Complaints) Act 1993"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4098cd29ae7064acaaacc19b8f644cf1bd2cb3586f1db27a2520c20b2f15eb0f" ;
    cof:pageNumber "49"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Member may make a complaint under AFCA scheme about superannuation provider's decision." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <c2022c00235.pdf> ;
    dc:source "c2022c00235.pdf, p.49" ;
