concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-58 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "58 Application of amendments"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-58 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The amendments made by this Part apply on and after the day that is:  (a) the day specified under subitem (2); or  (b) if no such day is specified—the day that is 12 months after the day (the Part 3 application day) on and after which the amendments made by Part 3 apply. Note: For the application of the amendments made by Part 3: see item 44.  External dispute resolution  Schedule 1 Amendments relating to closing off existing external dispute resolution schemes  Part 4  Treasury Laws Amendment (Putting Consumers First—Establishment of the Australian Financial Complaints Authority) Act 2018 Compilation date: 10/08/2022 Registered: 25/08/2022  (2) The Minister may, by notifiable instrument, specify a day for the purposes of paragraph (1)(a). The day must not be:  (a) earlier than the Part 3 application day; or  (b) later than 12 months after the Part 3 application day. (3) If the day specified under subitem (2) is the Part 3 application day, the amendments made by this Part apply on and from the time immediately after the start of the Part 3 application day.  Schedule 1  External dispute resolution" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The amendments made by this Part apply on and after the day that is:  (a) the day specified under subitem (2); or  (b) if no such day is specified—the day that is 12 months after the day (the Part 3 application day) on and after which the amendments made by Part 3 apply. Note: For the application of the amendments made by Part 3: see item 44.  External dispute resolution  Schedule 1 Amendments relating to closing off existing external dispute resolution schemes  Part 4  Treasury Laws Amendment (Putting Consumers First—Establishment of the Australian Financial Complaints Authority) Act 2018 Compilation date: 10/08/2022 Registered: 25/08/2022  (2) The Minister may, by notifiable instrument, specify a day for the purposes of paragraph (1)(a). The day must not be:  (a) earlier than the Part 3 application day; or  (b) later than 12 months after the Part 3 application day. (3) If the day specified under subitem (2) is the Part 3 application day, the amendments made by this Part apply on and from the time immediately after the start of the Part 3 application day.  Schedule 1  External dispute resolution"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "000c9abe0188f81c07447ed0bd62672423c8e3f25ac80c6a07fe1eb1c1ba147a" ;
    cof:pageNumber "50"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Specifies the day on which amendments apply" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <c2022c00235.pdf> ;
    dc:source "c2022c00235.pdf, p.50" ;
    cml:asserts concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-58-norm .
concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-58-norm a values:Undertaking ;
    cml:modality cml:Deontic ;
    values:partOf concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-58 ;
    values:deonticStatus values:HeuristicDerived ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .
concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-58 cml:asserts concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-58-logic-alleninterval-1 .
concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-58-logic-alleninterval-1 a cml:LogicApplication ;
    cml:modality cml:AllenInterval ;
    cml:operator "<=" ;
    cml:logicSummary "Defines the start of the amendment application period" ;
    cml:premiseText "(3)" ;
    cml:conclusionText "the day that is 12 months after the Part 3 application day" ;
    cml:executionSurface "modalities::interval_reasoning" ;
    cml:confidence "1.0000"^^xsd:decimal ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .
doc:sch-1-sec-58 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "58 Application of amendments" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The amendments made by this Part apply on and after the day that is:  (a) the day specified under subitem (2); or  (b) if no such day is specified—the day that is 12 months after the day (the Part 3 application day) on and after which the amendments made by Part 3 apply. Note: For the application of the amendments made by Part 3: see item 44.  External dispute resolution  Schedule 1 Amendments relating to closing off existing external dispute resolution schemes  Part 4  Treasury Laws Amendment (Putting Consumers First—Establishment of the Australian Financial Complaints Authority) Act 2018 Compilation date: 10/08/2022 Registered: 25/08/2022  (2) The Minister may, by notifiable instrument, specify a day for the purposes of paragraph (1)(a). The day must not be:  (a) earlier than the Part 3 application day; or  (b) later than 12 months after the Part 3 application day. (3) If the day specified under subitem (2) is the Part 3 application day, the amendments made by this Part apply on and from the time immediately after the start of the Part 3 application day.  Schedule 1  External dispute resolution" ;
    cof:pageNumber "50"^^xsd:integer .

