concept:c2022c00235-sch-2-sec-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3 After subsection 912A(2)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-3 ;
    values:originalText "Insert:  (2A) ASIC may, by legislative instrument, specify information that financial services licensees must give ASIC relating to their internal dispute resolution procedures and the operation of their internal dispute resolution procedures.  (2B) An instrument under subsection (2A) must not specify any information that is personal information within the meaning of the Privacy Act 1988." ;
