concept:c2022c00235-sch-3-sec-13 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "13 Subsection 95(1A)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-13 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (1A) If it appears to ASIC that an RSA provider has refused or failed to give effect to a determination made under the AFCA scheme (within the meaning of Chapter 7 of the Corporations Act 2001), ASIC may, by written notice, tell the RSA provider that ASIC proposes to conduct an investigation of the whole or a part of the affairs of the RSA provider." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (1A) If it appears to ASIC that an RSA provider has refused or failed to give effect to a determination made under the AFCA scheme (within the meaning of Chapter 7 of the Corporations Act 2001), ASIC may, by written notice, tell the RSA provider that ASIC proposes to conduct an investigation of the whole or a part of the affairs of the RSA provider."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "74a97d78b47c63893d9c7cbaefaaf1c707e79043c62b08fd766c47bd86381323" ;
    cof:pageNumber "62"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "ASIC may conduct an investigation if RSA provider refuses or fails to give effect to AFCA determination." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
